1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
X Focus Mode · Open-source Chrome preview

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Let obvious bait wait.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Reveal instantly. No vote is inferred.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Confirm a warning explicitly.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Your confirmation becomes a signed human report.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The warning remains visible alongside the post.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Reports are claims. Community auto-blur starts off.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Your provider account. Your credits.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Local Ollama is optional. No model weights in the extension.

10
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Sharing flags and distributing reports have separate controls.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Distribution can continue with X closed, while Chrome runs.

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Public reports are not anonymous. Peers may see your IP.

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Your attention deserves a considered choice.

14
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Developer preview · Live X and model validation pending.
